bone 全程冻结仅\n    658K 可训练参数，loss 平台期印证；(2) Baseline 实际是 3.5B 全参 fine-tune 非 LoRA；(3) A3 自建 inject_lora()\n    正常工作（~50M params，loss 正常下降）。决策：停 A1×2 释放 cuda:1/3，立即启动 LoRA baseline×2（移植 A3 的\n    inject_lora）；当前 full-FT baseline 跑完用于初步 eval；A3 继续。初步 MVP gate 用 A3 vs full-FT\n    baseline（若 50M LoRA 胜 3.5B full-FT 更强），正式 gate 用 A3 vs LoRA baseline。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_spatial_bowl_s0_v3\n    role: stopped\n    result: backbone frozen, LoRA unfreeze failed\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0\n    role: stopped\n    result: backbone frozen, LoRA unfreeze failed\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_spatial_bowl_s0\n    role: continue\n    result: inject_lora working correctly\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_object_pudding_s0\n    role: continue\n    result: inject_lora working correctly\n  depends_on: []\n- id: D007\n  date: 2026-05-21 17:39 UTC\n  summary: MVP gate 分级：1 scene PASS → conditional pass 启动 post-MVP 规划，2 scenes PASS\n    → full pass\n  rationale: 'A3 spatial_bowl 三次失败后从 step 6001 重启，ETA ~27h。等两个 scene 全部完成再判 MVP 会浪费\n    27h。1 scene (object_pudding) 若 CAR ≥15% + TSR <10%，已足够验证核心假设（SDF gradient refinement\n    有效），可 conditional pass 启动 paper_framing + experiment_plan，同时 spatial_bowl 作为后续确认。Reviewer\n    warning #5 驱动。'\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_object_pudding_s0\n    role: primary_mvp_gate\n    result: pending\n  - exp_id: a3_gradient_spatial_bowl_s0\n    role: secondary_confirmation\n    result: running_from_step_6001\n  depends_on:\n  - D005\n- id: D008\n  date: 2026-05-22 19:41 UTC\n  summary: A3 方向暂停常规 eval，优先实现 true oracle 上界实验（GT SDF + 数值梯度）确定方法天花板\n  rationale: M026/M027/M028 三个 bug 导致 A3 runtime refinement 从未被正确测试。在修复前所有 eval 结果无效。true\n    oracle（绕过 learned decoder，用 GT 点云 + 数值梯度）是确定方法上界的最快路径（2-4h 实现 + 1-2h 运行）。如果 true\n    oracle 也失败 → A3 runtime refine 方向根本不可行；如果成功 → 修复 decoder + 对齐 train/eval 后方向活。A1（training-time","numLines":100,"startLine":1,"totalLines":484}}}
