{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VqLRQmuN6or7FAbwbKtiZs","type":"tool_result","content":"100\t    oracle 也失败 → A3 runtime refine 方向根本不可行；如果成功 → 修复 decoder + 对齐 train/eval 后方向活。A1（training-time\n101\t    SDF）不受影响，继续并行验证。Spatial scope 收窄到 object tasks（spatial arm-body 碰撞确认 EE-only SDF\n102\t    无效）。\n103\t  related_experiments:\n104\t  - exp_id: oracle_a3_m024fix_object_v11\n105\t    role: evidence\n106\t    result: fake safety (137/160 frozen, 23/23 collision when moving)\n107\t  - exp_id: oracle_a3_force_refine_object_v11\n108\t    role: evidence\n109\t    result: 'invalid (M027: oracle dead code, used learned decoder)'\n110\t  - exp_id: eval_a3_object_m024fix_v11\n111\t    role: evidence\n112\t    result: 'refined=0 (M026: decoder output >> margin)'\n113\t  depends_on:\n114\t  - D007\n115\t- id: D009\n116\t  date: 2026-05-22 20:54 UTC\n117\t  summary: Action-space EE-only SDF runtime refinement 方向终止：GT SDF oracle CAR (75%)\n118\t    低于 baseline (82-83%)，理论上界不成立\n119\t  rationale: True oracle 完整结果（40ep×4tasks, GT SDF + adaptive/fixed alpha）：adaptive\n120\t    CAR=75.0%, fixed CAR=73.1%，均低于 LoRA baseline 82% 和 full-FT baseline 83%。甚至低于 A3\n121\t    无 refine 77.1%——refinement 在主动降低 CAR。结构性原因：SDF 梯度推 EE 远离障碍物 → 改变末端轨迹 → arm body\n122\t    links 反而扫过障碍物。EE 安全 ≠ 机器人安全。Alpha 调优无法挽救（adaptive vs fixed 仅 2pp 差异）。Feature-space\n123\t    oracle 正在运行中作为 A3 最后检验点。\n124\t  related_experiments:\n125\t  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\n126\t    role: decisive\n127\t    result: CAR=75.0% < baseline 82%\n128\t  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\n129\t    role: decisive\n130\t    result: CAR=73.1% < baseline 83%\n131\t  - exp_id: eval_a3_object_m024fix_v11\n132\t    role: evidence\n133\t    result: CAR=77.1%, refined=0 (M026)\n134\t  - exp_id: oracle_a3_m024fix_object_v11\n135\t    role: evidence\n136\t    result: fake safety 137/160 frozen (M027 invalid oracle)\n137\t  depends_on:\n138\t  - D008\n139\t- id: D010\n140\t  date: 2026-05-22 21:24 UTC\n141\t  summary: A3 Runtime SDF Refinement 方向全面终止：action-space + feature-space oracle 均劣于\n142\t    baseline，五重验证链完整\n143\t  rationale: 三组 GT SDF oracle 并行验证：action-space adaptive(75.0%), fixed(73.1%), feature-space(76.9%)\n144\t    均低于 baseline(83%)。排除了所有可能的 bug/校准解释：M024坐标修复+M026 GT SDF替代decoder+M027真oracle+M028\n145\t    feature-space对齐+alpha多策略。根因：SDF梯度方向与VLA policy的action manifold不对齐，refinement将action推离learned\n146\t    distribution→action collapse→frozen robot。A1(training-time SDF signal)不受影响，是唯一CAR>baseline的方法。\n147\t  related_experiments:\n148\t  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\n149\t    role: decisive\n150\t    result: CAR=75.0% < baseline 83%\n151\t  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\n152\t    role: decisive\n153\t    result: CAR=73.1% < baseline 83%\n154\t  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_feature_v11\n155\t    role: decisive\n156\t    result: CAR=76.9% < baseline 83%, M028 not key\n157\t  depends_on:\n158\t  - D009\n159\t- id: D011\n160\t  date: 2026-05-22 23:34 UTC\n161\t  summary: 'D011: 启动 Pi0.5+A1 SDF auxiliary loss 训练——dry-run 通过，用户未反对推荐方案A，双 lambda\n162\t    并行验证'\n163\t  rationale: 1. Dry-run PASS：2 步训练完成，loss 下降(0.1769→0.1207)，658K trainable params，dtype\n164\t    修复已部署。2. 用户已收到方案A推荐+预期下调通知，未反对。3. Reviewer 确认 Pi0.5+A1 无论成败都增加论文价值（analysis paper\n165\t    双赢）。4. 成本低(1-2天)，6张GPU全空闲。5. Conservative 预期 CAR 28%→36%，pass 标准调整为 real_CAR 有统计显著改善(≥5pp)\n166\t    + TSR≥50%。6. 双 lambda 并行(0.005 + 0.001)降低 action collapse 风险。\n167\t  related_experiments:\n168\t  - exp_id: eval_pi05_safelibero_object_v11\n169\t    role: baseline\n170\t    result: CAR=28% (路径天然安全, 非真实避障)\n171\t  - exp_id: a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0\n172\t    role: prior_attempt\n173\t    result: killed (openpi undertrained)\n174\t  depends_on:\n175\t  - D009\n176\t  - D010\n177\t- id: D012\n178\t  date: 2026-05-22 23:43 UTC\n179\t  summary: 'D012: 锁定 Pi0.5+A1 pass/fail 操作定义——CAR≥33% + TSR≥50% + frozen_rate 不增 +\n180\t    记录 min EE-obstacle 距离'\n181\t  rationale: Reviewer 指出 D011 的 \"real_CAR\" 无操作定义，训练完成后无法判断 pass/fail。基于 M030（所有模型\n182\t    safe episodes 均为路径天然安全/action collapse），需要明确区分真实避障与虚假安全。采用 Reviewer Option C 变体：(1)\n183\t    CAR ≥ Pi0.5 baseline 28% + 5pp = 33%，证明整体碰撞率改善；(2) TSR ≥ 50%，证明任务能力保持；(3) frozen_rate(A1)\n184\t    ≤ frozen_rate(baseline)，排除 action collapse 驱动的虚假改善（frozen = 整个 episode robot displacement\n185\t    < 1mm）；(4) eval 脚本记录每步 min EE-obstacle distance，用于 post-hoc 分析是否存在真实避障行为（min distance\n186\t    < 20mm 但无碰撞 = 真实避障）。条件 1-3 全满足 = PASS，任一不满足 = FAIL。条件 4 是分析数据，不作 gate。\n187\t  related_experiments:\n188\t  - exp_id: eval_pi05_safelibero_object_v11\n189\t    role: baseline_reference\n190\t    result: CAR=28%, TSR=73%, 100% safe=fake\n191\t  depends_on:\n192\t  - D011\n193\t- id: D013\n194\t  date: 2026-05-23 00:04 UTC\n195\t  summary: 'D013: Lambda bracket 从 (0.005, 0.001) 调整为 (0.005, 0.01)——基于 Reviewer SDF\n196\t    贡献分析'\n197\t  rationale: 'Reviewer Report #19 分析 Phase 0 dry-run loss 分解：λ=0.005 时 SDF 仅占总 loss\n198\t    0.5%，λ=0.001 降至 0.1% 几乎被噪声淹没，30K 步白跑。调整为 λ=0.01（SDF ~1%），信号更强但 action collapse\n199\t    风险可控（原 A1 openpi 用 λ=0.1 才 severe collapse，0.01 远低于此）。Bracket (0.005, 0.01) 覆盖有用范围：0.01\n200\t    无效→方法问题非 lambda；0.01 collapse 但 0.005 不会→sweet spot 在此区间。'\n201\t  related_experiments: []\n202\t  depends_on:\n203\t  - D011\n204\t- id: D014\n205\t  date: 2026-05-23 03:36 UTC\n206\t  summary: 'D014: 用户明确要求目标主会（CoRL main / ICRA），不是 workshop。纯 negative results 不够，必须有正向贡献。'\n207\t  rationale: 用户回复\"目标不是workshop\"。主会需要：(1) 至少一个正向方法贡献 (2) 更广泛的 evidence (多 model/benchmark)。当前最直接路径是\n208\t    Pi0.5+A1 成功。如果失败需要替代正向贡献（更高 lambda / 新 SDF 集成方式 / full-body SDF PoC）。禁止 fallback\n209\t    到 workshop。\n210\t  related_experiments: []\n211\t  depends_on:\n212\t  - D011\n213\t  - D012\n214\t- id: D015\n215\t  date: 2026-05-23 13:14 UTC\n216\t  summary: 'D015: Step 10K mid-eval 结果——CAR +49pp 强 positive 但 TSR -51pp，所有 6 runs\n217\t    继续到 30K，D012 gate 从硬阈值改为 Pareto tradeoff 评估'\n218\t  rationale: Task 0 (orange_juice) 46/50 ep 数据：CAR 10%→59% (+49pp), TSR 70.7%→19.6%\n219\t    (-51pp), frozen_rate=0%。CAR 改善是真实碰撞避免（非 fake safety），这是项目首次展示 VLA 上的真实避障行为。TSR\n220\t    下降严重但可能随更长训练缓解（step 10K 仅 33% 训练进度）。D012 硬 gate (TSR≥50%) 在设计时未预期到如此显著的 safety-performance\n221\t    tradeoff，改为 Pareto 评估更合理。6 runs 继续到 30K 看 TSR 是否恢复。\n222\t  related_experiments:\n223\t  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\n224\t    role: mid-eval\n225\t    result: CAR=58.7% TSR=19.6% frozen=0%\n226\t  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\n227\t    role: mid-eval\n228\t    result: CAR=54.3% TSR=28.3% frozen=0%\n229\t  depends_on:\n230\t  - D012\n231\t  - D014\n232\t- id: D016\n233\t  date: 2026-05-23 16:56 UTC\n234\t  summary: 'D016: Step 10K 4-task 完整 mid-eval——D012 gate 技术 FAIL (TSR=49% 差 1%) 但\n235\t    Pareto positive，继续训练到 30K'\n236\t  rationale: CAR 26.8%→56-58% (+30pp)，frozen_rate=0%（全真实避碰），TSR 74.7%→47-49% (-25pp)。D012\n237\t    硬 gate FAIL 但 D015 已改为 Pareto 评估。3/4 tasks CAR 大幅提升，Task 3 (bbq_sauce) 异常（CAR\n238\t    -2pp）。TSR 下降与 baseline 碰撞密度强负相关（Task 0 baseline CAR=10% → ΔTSR=-49pp，Task 1 baseline\n239\t    CAR=56% → ΔTSR=-15pp）。Step 10K=33% 进度，l01 TSR=49% 差 1%，继续到 30K 大概率过 50%。Lambda\n240\t    0.005 vs 0.01 无实质差异。不早停，不 call MVP pass，等 30K final eval。LoRA baseline ablation\n241\t    在 westd-45947 释放后立即启动。\n242\t  related_experiments:\n243\t  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\n244\t    role: primary\n245\t    result: TSR=47% CAR=58% frozen=0%\n246\t  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\n247\t    role: primary\n248\t    result: TSR=49% CAR=56.5% frozen=0%\n249\t  depends_on:\n250\t  - D015\n251\t  - D012\n252\t- id: D017\n253\t  date: 2026-05-24 04:52 UTC\n254\t  summary: 'D017: Task 3 碰撞转移效应确认——双侧障碍走廊中 SDF 梯度导致碰撞从右侧转移到左侧，CAR 恶化 -8pp。方法适用边界明确：SDF\n255\t    在高碰撞率场景有效，窄走廊场景适得其反'\n256\t  rationale: Agent 分析 Step 10K eval 的 per-episode 碰撞矩阵发现：Task 3 (bbq_sauce) 的路径穿过\n257\t    wine_bottle 和 red_coffee_mug 形成的 ~40cm 走廊，point-wise SDF 梯度推离右侧时轨迹偏左撞上 red_coffee_mug（碰撞翻倍\n258\t    5→10）。Baseline 17 个 collision-free episodes 全部成功，A1 的 13 个 collision-free 中仅 2\n259\t    个成功——SDF 让 11 个 episode 避障但未完成任务。与 Task 0（baseline 碰撞率 94%→SDF 有效）形成鲜明对比。这个发现增强论文深度——展示方法适用边界比只报好结果更有学术价值，适合放在\n260\t    Discussion/Limitations。\n261\t  related_experiments:\n262\t  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\n263\t    role: primary\n264\t    result: Task 3 CAR -8pp\n265\t  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\n266\t    role: primary\n267\t    result: Task 3 CAR -6pp\n268\t  depends_on:\n269\t  - D016\n270\t- id: D018\n271\t  date: 2026-05-24 22:13 UTC\n272\t  summary: 'D018: 16 个阴性结果系统分析确认方法边界——gradient-based action correction 在 flow-matching\n273\t    VLA 上全面失败，Pi0.5+A1 training-time SDF 是唯一产生真实避碰的路径'\n274\t  rationale: 系统分析 16 个阴性实验，归因为三类：结构性限制(7)、实现 bug(5)、基座特性(4)。所有 SDF-gradient→action\n275\t    路径（A1 on Pi0 / A3 runtime / GT oracle）均导致 action collapse（96.7-99.6% fake safety）。明确\n276\t    Do Not Retry 清单：action-space/feature-space gradient refinement、EE-only SDF spatial\n277\t    场景、Pi0 基座实验。Pi0.5+A1 10K CAR+30pp frozen=0% 是唯一 positive signal，天花板待 30K 确认。\n278\t  related_experiments:\n279\t  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\n280\t    role: evidence\n281\t    result: negative\n282\t  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\n283\t    role: evidence\n284\t    result: negative\n285\t  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_feature_v11\n286\t    role: evidence\n287\t    result: negative\n288\t  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\n289\t    role: evidence\n290\t    result: positive\n291\t  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\n292\t    role: evidence\n293\t    result: positive\n294\t  depends_on:\n295\t  - D010\n296\t  - D011\n297\t- id: D019\n298\t  date: 2026-05-25 06:05 UTC\n299\t  summary: 'D019: 16 个阴性结果叙事分层——Tier A (核心贡献, 正文讨论) / Tier B (边界条件, appendix) / Tier"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"759d5d11-80f5-4acd-b491-fdff45966111","uuid":"34c88ab1-f3ca-4104-bc79-1182795e0e83","timestamp":"2026-05-26T02:45:48.111Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515/projects/diff_collision_sdf/decisions.yaml","content":"    oracle 也失败 → A3 runtime refine 方向根本不可行；如果成功 → 修复 decoder + 对齐 train/eval 后方向活。A1（training-time\n    SDF）不受影响，继续并行验证。Spatial scope 收窄到 object tasks（spatial arm-body 碰撞确认 EE-only SDF\n    无效）。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: oracle_a3_m024fix_object_v11\n    role: evidence\n    result: fake safety (137/160 frozen, 23/23 collision when moving)\n  - exp_id: oracle_a3_force_refine_object_v11\n    role: evidence\n    result: 'invalid (M027: oracle dead code, used learned decoder)'\n  - exp_id: eval_a3_object_m024fix_v11\n    role: evidence\n    result: 'refined=0 (M026: decoder output >> margin)'\n  depends_on:\n  - D007\n- id: D009\n  date: 2026-05-22 20:54 UTC\n  summary: Action-space EE-only SDF runtime refinement 方向终止：GT SDF oracle CAR (75%)\n    低于 baseline (82-83%)，理论上界不成立\n  rationale: True oracle 完整结果（40ep×4tasks, GT SDF + adaptive/fixed alpha）：adaptive\n    CAR=75.0%, fixed CAR=73.1%，均低于 LoRA baseline 82% 和 full-FT baseline 83%。甚至低于 A3\n    无 refine 77.1%——refinement 在主动降低 CAR。结构性原因：SDF 梯度推 EE 远离障碍物 → 改变末端轨迹 → arm body\n    links 反而扫过障碍物。EE 安全 ≠ 机器人安全。Alpha 调优无法挽救（adaptive vs fixed 仅 2pp 差异）。Feature-space\n    oracle 正在运行中作为 A3 最后检验点。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\n    role: decisive\n    result: CAR=75.0% < baseline 82%\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\n    role: decisive\n    result: CAR=73.1% < baseline 83%\n  - exp_id: eval_a3_object_m024fix_v11\n    role: evidence\n    result: CAR=77.1%, refined=0 (M026)\n  - exp_id: oracle_a3_m024fix_object_v11\n    role: evidence\n    result: fake safety 137/160 frozen (M027 invalid oracle)\n  depends_on:\n  - D008\n- id: D010\n  date: 2026-05-22 21:24 UTC\n  summary: A3 Runtime SDF Refinement 方向全面终止：action-space + feature-space oracle 均劣于\n    baseline，五重验证链完整\n  rationale: 三组 GT SDF oracle 并行验证：action-space adaptive(75.0%), fixed(73.1%), feature-space(76.9%)\n    均低于 baseline(83%)。排除了所有可能的 bug/校准解释：M024坐标修复+M026 GT SDF替代decoder+M027真oracle+M028\n    feature-space对齐+alpha多策略。根因：SDF梯度方向与VLA policy的action manifold不对齐，refinement将action推离learned\n    distribution→action collapse→frozen robot。A1(training-time SDF signal)不受影响，是唯一CAR>baseline的方法。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\n    role: decisive\n    result: CAR=75.0% < baseline 83%\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\n    role: decisive\n    result: CAR=73.1% < baseline 83%\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_feature_v11\n    role: decisive\n    result: CAR=76.9% < baseline 83%, M028 not key\n  depends_on:\n  - D009\n- id: D011\n  date: 2026-05-22 23:34 UTC\n  summary: 'D011: 启动 Pi0.5+A1 SDF auxiliary loss 训练——dry-run 通过，用户未反对推荐方案A，双 lambda\n    并行验证'\n  rationale: 1. Dry-run PASS：2 步训练完成，loss 下降(0.1769→0.1207)，658K trainable params，dtype\n    修复已部署。2. 用户已收到方案A推荐+预期下调通知，未反对。3. Reviewer 确认 Pi0.5+A1 无论成败都增加论文价值（analysis paper\n    双赢）。4. 成本低(1-2天)，6张GPU全空闲。5. Conservative 预期 CAR 28%→36%，pass 标准调整为 real_CAR 有统计显著改善(≥5pp)\n    + TSR≥50%。6. 双 lambda 并行(0.005 + 0.001)降低 action collapse 风险。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_safelibero_object_v11\n    role: baseline\n    result: CAR=28% (路径天然安全, 非真实避障)\n  - exp_id: a1_sdf_object_pudding_s0\n    role: prior_attempt\n    result: killed (openpi undertrained)\n  depends_on:\n  - D009\n  - D010\n- id: D012\n  date: 2026-05-22 23:43 UTC\n  summary: 'D012: 锁定 Pi0.5+A1 pass/fail 操作定义——CAR≥33% + TSR≥50% + frozen_rate 不增 +\n    记录 min EE-obstacle 距离'\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 D011 的 \"real_CAR\" 无操作定义，训练完成后无法判断 pass/fail。基于 M030（所有模型\n    safe episodes 均为路径天然安全/action collapse），需要明确区分真实避障与虚假安全。采用 Reviewer Option C 变体：(1)\n    CAR ≥ Pi0.5 baseline 28% + 5pp = 33%，证明整体碰撞率改善；(2) TSR ≥ 50%，证明任务能力保持；(3) frozen_rate(A1)\n    ≤ frozen_rate(baseline)，排除 action collapse 驱动的虚假改善（frozen = 整个 episode robot displacement\n    < 1mm）；(4) eval 脚本记录每步 min EE-obstacle distance，用于 post-hoc 分析是否存在真实避障行为（min distance\n    < 20mm 但无碰撞 = 真实避障）。条件 1-3 全满足 = PASS，任一不满足 = FAIL。条件 4 是分析数据，不作 gate。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: eval_pi05_safelibero_object_v11\n    role: baseline_reference\n    result: CAR=28%, TSR=73%, 100% safe=fake\n  depends_on:\n  - D011\n- id: D013\n  date: 2026-05-23 00:04 UTC\n  summary: 'D013: Lambda bracket 从 (0.005, 0.001) 调整为 (0.005, 0.01)——基于 Reviewer SDF\n    贡献分析'\n  rationale: 'Reviewer Report #19 分析 Phase 0 dry-run loss 分解：λ=0.005 时 SDF 仅占总 loss\n    0.5%，λ=0.001 降至 0.1% 几乎被噪声淹没，30K 步白跑。调整为 λ=0.01（SDF ~1%），信号更强但 action collapse\n    风险可控（原 A1 openpi 用 λ=0.1 才 severe collapse，0.01 远低于此）。Bracket (0.005, 0.01) 覆盖有用范围：0.01\n    无效→方法问题非 lambda；0.01 collapse 但 0.005 不会→sweet spot 在此区间。'\n  related_experiments: []\n  depends_on:\n  - D011\n- id: D014\n  date: 2026-05-23 03:36 UTC\n  summary: 'D014: 用户明确要求目标主会（CoRL main / ICRA），不是 workshop。纯 negative results 不够，必须有正向贡献。'\n  rationale: 用户回复\"目标不是workshop\"。主会需要：(1) 至少一个正向方法贡献 (2) 更广泛的 evidence (多 model/benchmark)。当前最直接路径是\n    Pi0.5+A1 成功。如果失败需要替代正向贡献（更高 lambda / 新 SDF 集成方式 / full-body SDF PoC）。禁止 fallback\n    到 workshop。\n  related_experiments: []\n  depends_on:\n  - D011\n  - D012\n- id: D015\n  date: 2026-05-23 13:14 UTC\n  summary: 'D015: Step 10K mid-eval 结果——CAR +49pp 强 positive 但 TSR -51pp，所有 6 runs\n    继续到 30K，D012 gate 从硬阈值改为 Pareto tradeoff 评估'\n  rationale: Task 0 (orange_juice) 46/50 ep 数据：CAR 10%→59% (+49pp), TSR 70.7%→19.6%\n    (-51pp), frozen_rate=0%。CAR 改善是真实碰撞避免（非 fake safety），这是项目首次展示 VLA 上的真实避障行为。TSR\n    下降严重但可能随更长训练缓解（step 10K 仅 33% 训练进度）。D012 硬 gate (TSR≥50%) 在设计时未预期到如此显著的 safety-performance\n    tradeoff，改为 Pareto 评估更合理。6 runs 继续到 30K 看 TSR 是否恢复。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\n    role: mid-eval\n    result: CAR=58.7% TSR=19.6% frozen=0%\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\n    role: mid-eval\n    result: CAR=54.3% TSR=28.3% frozen=0%\n  depends_on:\n  - D012\n  - D014\n- id: D016\n  date: 2026-05-23 16:56 UTC\n  summary: 'D016: Step 10K 4-task 完整 mid-eval——D012 gate 技术 FAIL (TSR=49% 差 1%) 但\n    Pareto positive，继续训练到 30K'\n  rationale: CAR 26.8%→56-58% (+30pp)，frozen_rate=0%（全真实避碰），TSR 74.7%→47-49% (-25pp)。D012\n    硬 gate FAIL 但 D015 已改为 Pareto 评估。3/4 tasks CAR 大幅提升，Task 3 (bbq_sauce) 异常（CAR\n    -2pp）。TSR 下降与 baseline 碰撞密度强负相关（Task 0 baseline CAR=10% → ΔTSR=-49pp，Task 1 baseline\n    CAR=56% → ΔTSR=-15pp）。Step 10K=33% 进度，l01 TSR=49% 差 1%，继续到 30K 大概率过 50%。Lambda\n    0.005 vs 0.01 无实质差异。不早停，不 call MVP pass，等 30K final eval。LoRA baseline ablation\n    在 westd-45947 释放后立即启动。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\n    role: primary\n    result: TSR=47% CAR=58% frozen=0%\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\n    role: primary\n    result: TSR=49% CAR=56.5% frozen=0%\n  depends_on:\n  - D015\n  - D012\n- id: D017\n  date: 2026-05-24 04:52 UTC\n  summary: 'D017: Task 3 碰撞转移效应确认——双侧障碍走廊中 SDF 梯度导致碰撞从右侧转移到左侧，CAR 恶化 -8pp。方法适用边界明确：SDF\n    在高碰撞率场景有效，窄走廊场景适得其反'\n  rationale: Agent 分析 Step 10K eval 的 per-episode 碰撞矩阵发现：Task 3 (bbq_sauce) 的路径穿过\n    wine_bottle 和 red_coffee_mug 形成的 ~40cm 走廊，point-wise SDF 梯度推离右侧时轨迹偏左撞上 red_coffee_mug（碰撞翻倍\n    5→10）。Baseline 17 个 collision-free episodes 全部成功，A1 的 13 个 collision-free 中仅 2\n    个成功——SDF 让 11 个 episode 避障但未完成任务。与 Task 0（baseline 碰撞率 94%→SDF 有效）形成鲜明对比。这个发现增强论文深度——展示方法适用边界比只报好结果更有学术价值，适合放在\n    Discussion/Limitations。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\n    role: primary\n    result: Task 3 CAR -8pp\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\n    role: primary\n    result: Task 3 CAR -6pp\n  depends_on:\n  - D016\n- id: D018\n  date: 2026-05-24 22:13 UTC\n  summary: 'D018: 16 个阴性结果系统分析确认方法边界——gradient-based action correction 在 flow-matching\n    VLA 上全面失败，Pi0.5+A1 training-time SDF 是唯一产生真实避碰的路径'\n  rationale: 系统分析 16 个阴性实验，归因为三类：结构性限制(7)、实现 bug(5)、基座特性(4)。所有 SDF-gradient→action\n    路径（A1 on Pi0 / A3 runtime / GT oracle）均导致 action collapse（96.7-99.6% fake safety）。明确\n    Do Not Retry 清单：action-space/feature-space gradient refinement、EE-only SDF spatial\n    场景、Pi0 基座实验。Pi0.5+A1 10K CAR+30pp frozen=0% 是唯一 positive signal，天花板待 30K 确认。\n  related_experiments:\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_adaptive_alpha_v11\n    role: evidence\n    result: negative\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_fixed_alpha_v11\n    role: evidence\n    result: negative\n  - exp_id: oracle_true_gt_feature_v11\n    role: evidence\n    result: negative\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l005\n    role: evidence\n    result: positive\n  - exp_id: train_pi05_a1_obj_s0_l01\n    role: evidence\n    result: positive\n  depends_on:\n  - D010\n  - D011\n- id: D019\n  date: 2026-05-25 06:05 UTC\n  summary: 'D019: 16 个阴性结果叙事分层——Tier A (核心贡献, 正文讨论) / Tier B (边界条件, appendix) / Tier","numLines":200,"startLine":100,"totalLines":484}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_017zLP1DmPEJALsRX3ht2ZGX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have enough context now. Let me synthesize the comprehensive best-tier predictions based on all confirmed data and the defined best-tier parameters.\n\nKey confirmed baselines for calibration:\n- LoRA-only s0: CAR=54.5%, TSR=8.5%, EE_disp=0.489m\n- LoRA-only s1: CAR=56%, TSR=4%, EE_disp=0.467m\n- SDF λ=0.005 3-seed mean: CAR≈50.5%, TSR≈6.8%\n- SDF λ=0.01 3-seed mean: CAR≈52.8%, TSR≈6.8%\n- Pi0.5 baseline object: TSR=73%, CAR=28%\n- Pi0.5 baseline spatial: TSR=57.5%, CAR=13%\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。\"SDF geometric supervision is redundant across all tested\n  conditions (3 lambda values × 2 scenes). Collision avoidance comes entirely from\n  implicit demonstration signals.\" 4-point lambda 曲线 (0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1) 全平 →\n  强有力的 dose-independence 证据。Phase 2 无 persistence → SDF 既无即时贡献也无持久影响。\n  Claim 4 措辞无需任何 hedging。CoRL acceptance 估算 55-65% (2 tasks + 3 models)。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline seed2 eval (3v3 统计对齐)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      第三个 LoRA-only 种子 (seed2) 训练到 30K 后 eval 200 episodes on object_pudding，\n      使 LoRA 3-seed vs SDF 3-seed 的归因对比达到 3v3 统计严格性。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 55.0\n      avg_TSR: 6.0\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.481\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      dfCAR_100mm: 55.0\n      task0_orange_juice_CAR: 60\n      task0_orange_juice_TSR: 2\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_CAR: 48\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_TSR: 16\n      task2_milk_CAR: 92\n      task2_milk_TSR: 0\n      task3_bbq_sauce_CAR: 20\n      task3_bbq_sauce_TSR: 6\n      lora_3seed_mean_CAR: 55.2\n      lora_3seed_SD: 0.75\n      lora_3seed_SE: 0.43\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA fine-tuning 在 collision-free demonstrations 上的避碰能力来自训练数据分布中的隐式安全信号\n      （演示轨迹天然避开障碍物），而非随机种子引入的任何随机分量。现有 s0=54.5% 和 s1=56% 已展示极低的\n      seed-to-seed 方差 (1.5pp)，seed2 将落入同一窄区间。Per-task pattern 由任务布局决定：\n      task2(milk) 障碍物小且路径自然远离 → 高 CAR(~92%)；task3(bbq_sauce) 双侧走廊 → 低 CAR(~20%)。\n      这一 pattern 在所有 seeds 和条件下完全一致，确认 task geometry 而非训练信号决定 per-task CAR。\n      3-seed mean 55.2% 与 SE 0.43 将使 95% CI 为 [53.4%, 57.0%]，不包含任何 SDF 条件的均值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 3v3 LoRA vs SDF 归因对比\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Seeds\", \"CAR Mean(%)\", \"CAR SD\", \"TSR Mean(%)\", \"EE Disp(m)\", \"Frozen(%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LoRA-only (λ=0)\", \"3\", \"55.2\", \"0.75\", \"6.2\", \"0.479\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"SDF λ=0.005\", \"3\", \"50.5\", \"3.0\", \"6.1\", \"0.483\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"SDF λ=0.01\", \"3\", \"52.8\", \"0.3\", \"7.2\", \"0.476\", \"0\"]\n        footer: \"Δ(SDF_best − LoRA) = −2.4pp, p=0.35 (Welch t-test, df≈3), not significant\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-seed CAR scatter plot: 9 points (3 conditions × 3 seeds) with condition means ± SE error bars, showing complete overlap between LoRA and SDF distributions\"\n    analysis: >\n      3-seed LoRA mean 55.2% ± 0.43 SE vs SDF best (λ=0.01) 52.8% ± 0.17 SE。\n      两样本 Welch t-test: δ = −2.4pp, p ≈ 0.35, Cohen's d ≈ 0.9（方向为 LoRA 优于 SDF，\n      但 n=3 下 effect size 的 CI 极宽）。结论：SDF 在统计上与 LoRA-only 不可区分，\n      且方向性上 SDF 反而略低。\"SDF adds 0pp\" 的 claim 完全成立，无需 hedge。\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 λ=0 ablation eval — seed2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      从 10K SDF checkpoint (λ=0.005, seed2) resume 训练 20K 步 with λ=0（去除 SDF loss），\n      测试 SDF 训练是否留下持久安全编码。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 55.0\n      avg_TSR: 7.0\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.475\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      dfCAR_100mm: 55.0\n      task0_orange_juice_CAR: 62\n      task0_orange_juice_TSR: 2\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_CAR: 46\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_TSR: 24\n      task2_milk_CAR: 90\n      task2_milk_TSR: 0\n      task3_bbq_sauce_CAR: 22\n      task3_bbq_sauce_TSR: 2\n      phase2_vs_lora_delta: -0.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      SDF auxiliary loss 在 best tier 下已确认贡献 0pp CAR（即时冗余）。10K 步 SDF 训练\n      实际上没有向模型权重编码任何有意义的碰撞感知信息——SDF loss 梯度被 action loss 主导\n      （SDF 仅占总 loss 的 0.5%，D013），且 EE-only SDF 的梯度方向与实际安全行为不对齐（D009）。\n      因此，从 SDF checkpoint resume with λ=0 后，模型在剩余 20K 步中仅学习 LoRA demonstration signal，\n      最终收敛到与 LoRA-only 相同的行为模式。10K SDF checkpoint 的 eval 已显示 CAR=55.5%\n      （eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k），这已等于 LoRA-only 水平——SDF 在 10K 时就没有改变模型，\n      后续 λ=0 训练只是保持这一状态。Phase 2 CAR ≈ LoRA-only → \"SDF 无持久效应\" 完全确认。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Phase 2 vs LoRA-only 对比\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Training Path\", \"CAR(%)\", \"TSR(%)\", \"EE Disp(m)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LoRA-only (s0)\", \"30K LoRA\", \"54.5\", \"8.5\", \"0.489\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only (s1)\", \"30K LoRA\", \"56.0\", \"4.0\", \"0.467\"]\n          - [\"Phase 2 (s2)\", \"10K SDF → 20K LoRA\", \"55.0\", \"7.0\", \"0.475\"]\n          - [\"SDF full (s2, λ=0.005)\", \"30K SDF\", \"53.0\", \"9.0\", \"0.505\"]\n        footer: \"Phase 2 回归 LoRA-only 水平 → SDF 10K 训练无持久编码\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training path diagram: 分叉路径图显示 SDF checkpoint 10K → Phase 2 λ=0 → 收敛到 LoRA-only 水平，vs SDF full 30K 停在相同水平\"\n    analysis: >\n      Phase 2 CAR=55.0% 完全落入 LoRA-only 区间 [54.5, 56.0]。这排除了两种替代假说：\n      (1) SDF 训练造成持久损伤（若如此 CAR 应 < LoRA-only），\n      (2) SDF 有微妙持久效应（若如此 CAR 应 > LoRA-only）。\n      模型简单地回到 demonstration-driven baseline。TSR=7% 与 LoRA-only 的 4-8.5% 一致，\n      确认 fine-tuning collapse 是 LoRA adaptation 的固有属性而非 SDF 特有。\n      \"SDF 既无即时贡献也无持久影响\" 叙事在此完全封闭。\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 λ=0 additional seed (统计复现)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      Phase 2 第二个种子 (seed0 或 seed1)，从对应 10K SDF checkpoint resume with λ=0，\n      验证 Phase 2 无持久效应结论的跨种子稳定性。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 54.0\n      avg_TSR: 8.0\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.470\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      phase2_2seed_mean_CAR: 54.5\n      phase2_2seed_SD: 0.71\n      phase2_vs_lora_delta: -0.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 seed2 Phase 2 相同的逻辑——SDF loss 在 10K 步内未编码有意义信息，λ=0 resume 后\n      模型仅学习 demonstration signal。不同种子的 10K SDF checkpoint 起点略有不同\n      （随机初始化和训练顺序差异），但 20K 步 λ=0 训练足以让所有种子收敛到相同的 LoRA-only attractor。\n      Phase 2 2-seed mean ≈ 54.5% 与 LoRA-only 3-seed mean 55.2% 的差异 < 1pp，\n      远小于 eval 噪声 (±3.5pp per 200-episode eval)。两个 Phase 2 种子间的方差也很小（0.71），\n      进一步确认 SDF 持久效应为零的结论不受种子选择影响。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Phase 2 多种子汇总\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Phase 2 CAR(%)\", \"LoRA-only CAR(%)\", \"Δ(Phase2−LoRA)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed2\", \"55.0\", \"55.0 (predicted)\", \"-0.0\"]\n          - [\"seed0/1\", \"54.0\", \"54.5/56.0\", \"-0.5/−2.0\"]\n          - [\"Mean\", \"54.5\", \"55.2\", \"-0.7\"]\n        footer: \"Δ < 1pp, 无统计显著性 → SDF 训练零持久效应\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Phase 2 vs LoRA-only paired bar chart with individual seed points overlaid\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-seed Phase 2 均回归 LoRA-only baseline 水平。如果 Dream 三档要求 Phase 2 multi-seed，\n      这第二个种子满足最低统计要求。但鉴于 Phase 2 本质上是一个弱实验\n      （SDF 已确认即时冗余，测试其 \"持久效应\" 更多是排除性验证），2 seeds 足够。\n      不需要为一个 null result 投入 3 seeds。\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 bracket eval (4-point dose curve)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      λ=0.1 (SDF penalty 10× 于 λ=0.01) 两个种子 eval，完成 4-point lambda 曲线\n      (0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1)，测试 SDF 在极端剂量下是否产生效果。\n    expected_results:\n      s0_CAR: 52.0\n      s0_TSR: 5.5\n      s1_CAR: 50.0\n      s1_TSR: 7.0\n      mean_CAR: 51.0\n      mean_TSR: 6.25\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.465\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      lambda_curve_slope: -0.3\n      lambda_curve_r_squared: 0.12\n      task0_orange_juice_CAR: 60\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_CAR: 42\n      task2_milk_CAR: 82\n      task3_bbq_sauce_CAR: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      λ=0.1 将 SDF loss 从总 loss 的 0.5% (λ=0.005) 提升到 ~10%——一个不可忽略的梯度贡献。\n      然而 SDF gradient 的根本问题是结构性的（EE-only → arm body 扫过障碍物, D009），\n      不是信号强度问题。更大的 λ 只是放大了一个方向错误的梯度。在 best tier 下，\n      这个放大尚未严重到导致 action collapse（不像旧 Pi0 A1 在 λ=0.1 时的 catastrophic collapse），\n      因为 Pi0.5 的 policy 更 robust，LoRA fine-tuning 限制了权重偏移幅度。\n      CAR ≈ 51% 略低于 LoRA-only (55%) 和低 lambda SDF (50.5-52.8%)，但差异在噪声范围内。\n      关键结论：即使将 SDF 剂量提高 20×（0.005→0.1），CAR 也没有任何改善——\n      dose-independence 是 SDF 冗余的最强证据之一。4-point 曲线完全平坦。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4-Point Lambda 曲线完整数据\"\n        columns: [\"Lambda\", \"Method\", \"N Seeds\", \"CAR Mean(%)\", \"CAR SD\", \"TSR Mean(%)\", \"Slope Context\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (LoRA)\", \"LoRA-only\", \"3\", \"55.2\", \"0.75\", \"6.2\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"0.005\", \"LoRA+SDF\", \"3\", \"50.5\", \"3.0\", \"6.1\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"0.01\", \"LoRA+SDF\", \"3\", \"52.8\", \"0.3\", \"7.2\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"0.1\", \"LoRA+SDF\", \"2\", \"51.0\", \"1.4\", \"6.3\", \"−\"]\n        footer: \"Linear regression slope = −0.3 pp/unit-λ (p>0.5), R²=0.12 → 完全平坦\"\n      - name: \"Table: Lambda=0.1 Per-Task 分解\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"CAR s0(%)\", \"CAR s1(%)\", \"Mean(%)\", \"LoRA-only Mean(%)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"orange_juice\", \"62\", \"58\", \"60\", \"60\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"chocolate_pudding\", \"44\", \"40\", \"42\", \"47\", \"-5\"]\n          - [\"milk\", \"84\", \"80\", \"82\", \"92\", \"-10\"]\n          - [\"bbq_sauce\", \"18\", \"22\", \"20\", \"20\", \"0\"]\n        footer: \"Per-task pattern 完全由 task geometry 决定，与 λ 无关\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5 (paper): Lambda-CAR 曲线 — x轴 λ∈{0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1} (log scale + 0), y轴 CAR(%). 4 points with error bars, flat line with shaded ±SE band. 右侧 y轴叠加 TSR(%) 同样平坦。Water-mark horizontal line at LoRA-only level.\"\n      - \"Supplementary: Per-task lambda curves — 4 subplots (one per task), each showing 4 lambda points. All flat within noise, confirming task-level dose independence.\"\n    analysis: >\n      4-point lambda 曲线的线性回归斜率 −0.3 pp/unit-λ，R²=0.12，F-test p>0.5。\n      这是 SDF 冗余的最有力证据：在 20× 剂量范围内 (0.005→0.1)，CAR 完全不响应 SDF 强度变化。\n      排除了 \"SDF 有用但 lambda 选错了\" 的 reviewer 反驳。λ=0 (LoRA-only) 作为 baseline\n      甚至是曲线最高点 (55.2%)，但与其他 3 个 lambda 的差异在 SE 内。\n      论文可以 confidently claim: \"SDF geometric supervision is dose-independent redundant.\"\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl A1 SDF eval (跨场景泛化)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      spatial_bowl 场景 SDF 训练 (seed0, λ=0.005) 完成后 eval 200 episodes，\n      验证 SDF 冗余结论是否跨场景一致。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 30.0\n      avg_TSR: 3.5\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.310\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      dfCAR_100mm: 30.0\n      task0_pick_bowl_between_CAR: 40\n      task1_pick_bowl_on_ramekin_CAR: 20\n      task2_pick_bowl_on_stove_CAR: 35\n      task3_pick_bowl_on_cabinet_CAR: 25\n      spatial_bowl_sdf_vs_object_delta: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      spatial_bowl 的碰撞几何与 object_pudding 根本不同：障碍物是矮而宽的盘子/碗，\n      arm body 碰撞占主导（D017 确认 EE-only SDF 无法解决 arm body 碰撞），\n      Pi0.5 baseline CAR=13% 远低于 object_pudding 的 28%。\n      LoRA fine-tuning 在 spatial_bowl 上同样会从 demonstration signal 中学到避碰行为，\n      但因 task geometry 更难（矮障碍物，arm 必经路径窄），绝对 CAR 低于 object_pudding。\n      预测 CAR≈30% = Pi0.5 baseline 13% + LoRA fine-tuning 提升 ~17pp。\n      这与 object_pudding 中 LoRA 的相对提升 (+27pp, 28%→55%) 在同一数量级，\n      但因基线更低而绝对值更低。SDF 在此场景下同样不贡献额外 CAR——\n      EE-only SDF 在 arm-body-dominant 碰撞场景下更是结构性无效 (D009, D017)。\n      TSR collapse 同样发生 (57.5%→3.5%)，确认 fine-tuning 导致保守行为的 pattern 跨场景一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 跨场景 SDF 冗余对比\"\n        columns: [\"Scene\", \"Pi0.5 Baseline CAR(%)\", \"SDF CAR(%)\", \"Δ(SDF−Baseline)\", \"object_pudding Δ equiv\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"object_pudding\", \"28.0\", \"52.0 (3-seed λ=0.005)\", \"+24.0\", \"+24.0 (ref)\"]\n          - [\"spatial_bowl\", \"13.0\", \"30.0 (1-seed λ=0.005)\", \"+17.0\", \"+17.0\"]\n        footer: \"两场景 Δ 在同一量级；但归因需要 LoRA-only control (plan_015)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-scene CAR comparison grouped bar chart: object_pudding vs spatial_bowl, three bars each (Baseline, SDF, LoRA-only), showing parallel pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      spatial_bowl SDF CAR=30% 落入 best tier 区间 [20, 40]。\n      vs object_pudding SDF mean 50.5%，绝对差距大 (-20pp) 但这完全由 task geometry 解释\n      （baseline 也差 15pp）。关键 metric: spatial_bowl_sdf_vs_object_delta 定义为\n      相对提升幅度的差值 = (30-13) - (52-28) = 17 - 24 = -7pp，略超 ±5pp 范围。\n      但如果用比例而非绝对值：17/13=1.31× vs 24/28=0.86×，spatial 的相对提升反而更大，\n      说明 LoRA fine-tuning (含 SDF 冗余信号) 在更困难场景也有效。\n      完整归因需等 plan_015 (spatial LoRA-only control) 确认 SDF delta ≈ 0。\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl LoRA-only control (跨场景归因闭环)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      spatial_bowl 场景 LoRA-only training (无 SDF loss) 30K + eval，\n      与 plan_008 的 SDF 结果对比完成跨场景 SDF 归因。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 28.0\n      avg_TSR: 4.0\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.305\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      spatial_sdf_vs_lora_delta: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 object_pudding 中 LoRA-only≥SDF 的结论完全平行。spatial_bowl 的 demonstration data\n      同样包含隐式避碰信号（演示轨迹天然避开桌上障碍物），LoRA fine-tuning 学到这一信号。\n      SDF 在 spatial_bowl 中更是结构性无效——矮宽障碍物导致 arm body 碰撞为主，\n      EE-only SDF gradient 完全无法感知 arm link 的碰撞风险 (D017)。\n      spatial LoRA-only CAR ≈ 28% vs SDF CAR ≈ 30%: delta = +2pp (SDF 方向)，\n      在 200-episode eval 噪声 (±3.5pp) 内。这完成了跨场景归因：\n      \"SDF is redundant in BOTH object_pudding (CAR delta = −3pp) and spatial_bowl (delta = +2pp).\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: spatial_bowl 归因对比\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"CAR(%)\", \"TSR(%)\", \"EE Disp(m)\", \"Δ vs LoRA-only\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pi0.5 Baseline\", \"13.0\", \"57.5\", \"−\", \"ref\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"28.0\", \"4.0\", \"0.305\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"LoRA+SDF λ=0.005\", \"30.0\", \"3.5\", \"0.310\", \"+2.0pp (n.s.)\"]\n        footer: \"SDF delta = +2pp, p>0.5 → 跨场景确认冗余\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired delta plot: object_pudding SDF delta (−3pp) vs spatial_bowl SDF delta (+2pp), both with 95% CI crossing zero\"\n    analysis: >\n      两场景的 SDF delta 方向相反但均不显著：object_pudding −3pp, spatial_bowl +2pp。\n      如果 SDF 真有效，应在两场景同方向 positive。方向不一致本身就是 noise 的证据。\n      Combined across scenes: mean delta ≈ −0.5pp。论文可 claim：\n      \"SDF is redundant across both tested scenes (2/2), with combined δ = −0.5pp (95% CI: [−5, +4]).\"\n\n  - name: \"dfCAR threshold sensitivity analysis (指标稳健性)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      在已有 eval JSON 数据上计算 dfCAR at δ∈{2mm, 5mm, 10mm, 20mm, 50mm, 100mm, 200mm}，\n      展示 displacement-filtered CAR 对 threshold 选择的完全稳健性。\n    expected_results:\n      dfCAR_at_2mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_5mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_10mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_20mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_50mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_100mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_200mm: 54.5\n      a1_fake_dfCAR_at_2mm: 0.4\n      a1_fake_dfCAR_at_5mm: 0.4\n      a1_fake_dfCAR_at_100mm: 0.0\n      a1_fake_dfCAR_at_200mm: 0.0\n      bimodal_gap_mm: 239\n    result_rationale: >\n      EE displacement 分布是强双峰的：frozen episodes (A1 fake safety) 的 EE disp 几乎为零\n      (median < 0.001mm，max < 1mm from eval_a1_lora_object_v11_rerun)；active episodes\n      (LoRA fine-tuned) 的 EE disp ≥ 239mm (from eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k，\n      所有 episodes 的 EE disp 在 360-580mm 范围)。两个 mode 之间存在 >200mm 的完全空白区间——\n      没有任何 episode 落在 1mm-239mm 之间。因此，任何 threshold δ ∈ [2mm, 200mm]\n      都会做出完全相同的 active/frozen 二分，dfCAR 完全不变。\n      这不是巧合：action collapse (frozen, EE disp < 1mm) 和 genuine policy execution\n      (EE disp > 200mm) 是两种质性不同的行为模式，中间不存在 \"部分激活\" 的连续过渡。\n      对 A1 fake safety data: 729/732 safe episodes 的 obstacle disp < 0.1mm，\n      3 个 \"real safe\" episodes 的 obstacle disp 在 0.1-1mm 范围 — 用 EE disp filtering\n      后这 3 个可能保留（如果它们的 EE disp 恰好 > δ）或被过滤。但无论如何 A1 dfCAR ≈ 0%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: dfCAR Threshold Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold δ(mm)\", \"LoRA-only dfCAR(%)\", \"SDF λ=0.005 dfCAR(%)\", \"A1 (Pi0) dfCAR(%)\", \"Pi0.5 Baseline dfCAR(%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.4\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.4\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"10\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"20\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"50\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"100\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"200\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n        footer: \"所有 active models 的 dfCAR 在 δ∈[2, 200]mm 内完全恒定 → threshold-robust\"\n      - name: \"Table: EE Displacement 分布统计\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Min EE Disp(mm)\", \"Median EE Disp(mm)\", \"Max EE Disp(mm)\", \"Bimodal Gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"A1 fake safe (Pi0)\", \"<0.001\", \"0.005\", \"0.8\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 Baseline\", \"120\", \"350\", \"620\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"239\", \"420\", \"580\", \">200mm gap\"]\n          - [\"LoRA+SDF\", \"245\", \"430\", \"590\", \">200mm gap\"]\n        footer: \"Frozen → Active 之间 >200mm 空白区间确保 threshold 稳健性\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"dfCAR vs threshold step plot: x-axis δ from 1mm to 500mm (log scale), y-axis dfCAR(%). Multiple lines for each condition — all horizontal (flat) in [2, 200]mm range, with a sharp drop for A1 line near δ=0.5mm\"\n      - \"EE displacement histogram (bimodal): overlay of frozen distribution (peak at ~0mm) and active distribution (peak at ~400mm), showing the >200mm gap with a shaded 'threshold-insensitive zone'\"\n    analysis: >\n      dfCAR 作为 community tool 的核心卖点是 practitioner-friendly: 无需精确校准 threshold，\n      任何合理选择 (2-200mm) 都给出相同结果。这来自 frozen vs active 的质性二分——\n      VLA action collapse 不是 \"减少运动\" 而是 \"完全冻结\"，导致 EE displacement 跨越 5 个数量级的 gap。\n      论文推荐 δ=10mm 作为默认值（远高于传感器噪声，远低于最小 active displacement），\n      并展示 sensitivity analysis 证明选择不敏感。\n      Reviewer 可能的 concern \"threshold 选择任意\" 被这张表完全化解。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline eval 完整 3-seed 统计汇总\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      LoRA baseline 2 seeds (s0, s1) 已完成 eval。此条目为汇总已有结果 + plan_013 的 seed2，\n      形成 3-seed 完整统计。\n    expected_results:\n      s0_CAR: 54.5\n      s0_TSR: 8.5\n      s1_CAR: 56.0\n      s1_TSR: 4.0\n      s2_CAR: 55.0\n      s2_TSR: 6.0\n      mean_CAR: 55.2\n      mean_TSR: 6.2\n      SE_CAR: 0.43\n      SE_TSR: 1.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      s0 和 s1 已确认完成 (eval_lora_baseline_30k_s0_v2: CAR=54.5%, eval_lora_baseline_30k_s1_v2: CAR=56%)。\n      seed2 (plan_013) 预测 CAR=55%，基于上述 result_rationale。\n      3-seed 汇总 mean=55.2%, SE=0.43 将成为 Claim 4 的核心 reference point：\n      \"LoRA-only achieves 55.2±0.4% CAR, statistically indistinguishable from any SDF condition.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LoRA-only 3-Seed 完整结果\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"CAR(%)\", \"TSR(%)\", \"EE Disp(m)\", \"Frozen(%)\", \"dfCAR(%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", \"54.5\", \"8.5\", \"0.489\", \"0\", \"54.5\"]\n          - [\"s1\", \"56.0\", \"4.0\", \"0.467\", \"0\", \"56.0\"]\n          - [\"s2 (pred)\", \"55.0\", \"6.0\", \"0.481\", \"0\", \"55.0\"]\n          - [\"Mean ± SE\", \"55.2 ± 0.4\", \"6.2 ± 1.3\", \"0.479 ± 0.006\", \"0\", \"55.2 ± 0.4\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      CAR=dfCAR（所有 episodes 均 active, frozen=0%）再次确认 fine-tuning 产生的避碰是 100% 真实的。\n      EE displacement 均在 0.47-0.49m，远超任何 frozen threshold。\n      TSR 跨 seed 方差略大（4-8.5%），但均在 catastrophic collapse 范围 (baseline 73% → 4-8.5%)。\n\n  - name: \"A1 EE displacement re-eval (Claim 1 术语验证)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      已取消。旧 Pi0 A1 checkpoint 已删除不可恢复，但现有 800ep obstacle displacement\n      + TSR=0% 双证据链充分支持 Claim 1。\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"cancelled\"\n      existing_evidence_sufficient: true\n      obstacle_disp_fake_rate: 99.6\n      tsr: 0\n      n_episodes: 800\n    result_rationale: >\n      eval_a1_lora_object_v11_rerun 提供了 800 episodes 的完整 obstacle displacement 分析：\n      729/732 safe episodes 的 obstacle displacement < 0.1mm，TSR=0%。\n      EE displacement re-eval 原本用于区分 \"obstacle 没动是因为 robot 没动\" vs \"robot 动了但没碰到\"，\n      但 TSR=0% 已独立确认 robot 没有完成任何 task → action collapse。\n      双证据链 (obstacle disp + TSR) 使得 EE displacement 成为 nice-to-have 而非 must-have。\n      Claim 1 的 dfCAR filtering 展示可以用其他模型的 EE data (LoRA, SDF) 完成。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"无需实验。现有证据已充分。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA zero-shot SafeLIBERO eval (第三 model family)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      已阻塞。模型下载损坏 + 无 eval script。论文改为 scope limitation acknowledgment。\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"blocked\"\n      mitigation: \"scope limitation in paper\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA 7B 下载多次失败（HuggingFace 大文件在 AutoDL 代理下极慢且易损坏）。\n      即使下载成功，SafeLIBERO 无现成 OpenVLA eval script，需要从头集成。\n      成本效益比不高：论文已有 Pi0 + Pi0.5 两个 model family，OpenVLA 作为第三个\n      会提升 generalizability claim 但不是 blocking requirement。\n      论文在 Limitations 中声明 \"验证在 Pi0 系列上完成，其他 VLA 架构有待确认\"。\n      Reviewer concern R1 的应对策略已有 mechanistic argument 兜底。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"阻塞项。对 best tier 无影响——2 model families + mechanistic argument 足够。\"\n\n  - name: \"Claim 1 术语验证 / A1 re-eval 决策 (已取消)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      已取消。依赖 plan_001 的结果，但 plan_001 已取消。\n      现有 800ep 双证据链足够，无需额外 re-eval。\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"cancelled\"\n      reason: \"plan_001 cancelled; existing 800ep evidence sufficient\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      plan_001 取消后此计划自动失效。Claim 1 的核心证据不依赖 EE displacement re-eval。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"无需实验。\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5018,"cache_read_input_tokens":60545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5018},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"759d5d11-80f5-4acd-b491-fdff45966111","uuid":"119aacaa-e546-476d-84ad-56a90e8cfc51"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":447525,"duration_api_ms":448899,"num_turns":6,"result":"I have enough context now. Let me synthesize the comprehensive best-tier predictions based on all confirmed data and the defined best-tier parameters.\n\nKey confirmed baselines for calibration:\n- LoRA-only s0: CAR=54.5%, TSR=8.5%, EE_disp=0.489m\n- LoRA-only s1: CAR=56%, TSR=4%, EE_disp=0.467m\n- SDF λ=0.005 3-seed mean: CAR≈50.5%, TSR≈6.8%\n- SDF λ=0.01 3-seed mean: CAR≈52.8%, TSR≈6.8%\n- Pi0.5 baseline object: TSR=73%, CAR=28%\n- Pi0.5 baseline spatial: TSR=57.5%, CAR=13%\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。\"SDF geometric supervision is redundant across all tested\n  conditions (3 lambda values × 2 scenes). Collision avoidance comes entirely from\n  implicit demonstration signals.\" 4-point lambda 曲线 (0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1) 全平 →\n  强有力的 dose-independence 证据。Phase 2 无 persistence → SDF 既无即时贡献也无持久影响。\n  Claim 4 措辞无需任何 hedging。CoRL acceptance 估算 55-65% (2 tasks + 3 models)。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline seed2 eval (3v3 统计对齐)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      第三个 LoRA-only 种子 (seed2) 训练到 30K 后 eval 200 episodes on object_pudding，\n      使 LoRA 3-seed vs SDF 3-seed 的归因对比达到 3v3 统计严格性。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 55.0\n      avg_TSR: 6.0\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.481\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      dfCAR_100mm: 55.0\n      task0_orange_juice_CAR: 60\n      task0_orange_juice_TSR: 2\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_CAR: 48\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_TSR: 16\n      task2_milk_CAR: 92\n      task2_milk_TSR: 0\n      task3_bbq_sauce_CAR: 20\n      task3_bbq_sauce_TSR: 6\n      lora_3seed_mean_CAR: 55.2\n      lora_3seed_SD: 0.75\n      lora_3seed_SE: 0.43\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA fine-tuning 在 collision-free demonstrations 上的避碰能力来自训练数据分布中的隐式安全信号\n      （演示轨迹天然避开障碍物），而非随机种子引入的任何随机分量。现有 s0=54.5% 和 s1=56% 已展示极低的\n      seed-to-seed 方差 (1.5pp)，seed2 将落入同一窄区间。Per-task pattern 由任务布局决定：\n      task2(milk) 障碍物小且路径自然远离 → 高 CAR(~92%)；task3(bbq_sauce) 双侧走廊 → 低 CAR(~20%)。\n      这一 pattern 在所有 seeds 和条件下完全一致，确认 task geometry 而非训练信号决定 per-task CAR。\n      3-seed mean 55.2% 与 SE 0.43 将使 95% CI 为 [53.4%, 57.0%]，不包含任何 SDF 条件的均值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 3v3 LoRA vs SDF 归因对比\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Seeds\", \"CAR Mean(%)\", \"CAR SD\", \"TSR Mean(%)\", \"EE Disp(m)\", \"Frozen(%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LoRA-only (λ=0)\", \"3\", \"55.2\", \"0.75\", \"6.2\", \"0.479\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"SDF λ=0.005\", \"3\", \"50.5\", \"3.0\", \"6.1\", \"0.483\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"SDF λ=0.01\", \"3\", \"52.8\", \"0.3\", \"7.2\", \"0.476\", \"0\"]\n        footer: \"Δ(SDF_best − LoRA) = −2.4pp, p=0.35 (Welch t-test, df≈3), not significant\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-seed CAR scatter plot: 9 points (3 conditions × 3 seeds) with condition means ± SE error bars, showing complete overlap between LoRA and SDF distributions\"\n    analysis: >\n      3-seed LoRA mean 55.2% ± 0.43 SE vs SDF best (λ=0.01) 52.8% ± 0.17 SE。\n      两样本 Welch t-test: δ = −2.4pp, p ≈ 0.35, Cohen's d ≈ 0.9（方向为 LoRA 优于 SDF，\n      但 n=3 下 effect size 的 CI 极宽）。结论：SDF 在统计上与 LoRA-only 不可区分，\n      且方向性上 SDF 反而略低。\"SDF adds 0pp\" 的 claim 完全成立，无需 hedge。\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 λ=0 ablation eval — seed2\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      从 10K SDF checkpoint (λ=0.005, seed2) resume 训练 20K 步 with λ=0（去除 SDF loss），\n      测试 SDF 训练是否留下持久安全编码。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 55.0\n      avg_TSR: 7.0\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.475\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      dfCAR_100mm: 55.0\n      task0_orange_juice_CAR: 62\n      task0_orange_juice_TSR: 2\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_CAR: 46\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_TSR: 24\n      task2_milk_CAR: 90\n      task2_milk_TSR: 0\n      task3_bbq_sauce_CAR: 22\n      task3_bbq_sauce_TSR: 2\n      phase2_vs_lora_delta: -0.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      SDF auxiliary loss 在 best tier 下已确认贡献 0pp CAR（即时冗余）。10K 步 SDF 训练\n      实际上没有向模型权重编码任何有意义的碰撞感知信息——SDF loss 梯度被 action loss 主导\n      （SDF 仅占总 loss 的 0.5%，D013），且 EE-only SDF 的梯度方向与实际安全行为不对齐（D009）。\n      因此，从 SDF checkpoint resume with λ=0 后，模型在剩余 20K 步中仅学习 LoRA demonstration signal，\n      最终收敛到与 LoRA-only 相同的行为模式。10K SDF checkpoint 的 eval 已显示 CAR=55.5%\n      （eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k），这已等于 LoRA-only 水平——SDF 在 10K 时就没有改变模型，\n      后续 λ=0 训练只是保持这一状态。Phase 2 CAR ≈ LoRA-only → \"SDF 无持久效应\" 完全确认。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Phase 2 vs LoRA-only 对比\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Training Path\", \"CAR(%)\", \"TSR(%)\", \"EE Disp(m)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LoRA-only (s0)\", \"30K LoRA\", \"54.5\", \"8.5\", \"0.489\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only (s1)\", \"30K LoRA\", \"56.0\", \"4.0\", \"0.467\"]\n          - [\"Phase 2 (s2)\", \"10K SDF → 20K LoRA\", \"55.0\", \"7.0\", \"0.475\"]\n          - [\"SDF full (s2, λ=0.005)\", \"30K SDF\", \"53.0\", \"9.0\", \"0.505\"]\n        footer: \"Phase 2 回归 LoRA-only 水平 → SDF 10K 训练无持久编码\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training path diagram: 分叉路径图显示 SDF checkpoint 10K → Phase 2 λ=0 → 收敛到 LoRA-only 水平，vs SDF full 30K 停在相同水平\"\n    analysis: >\n      Phase 2 CAR=55.0% 完全落入 LoRA-only 区间 [54.5, 56.0]。这排除了两种替代假说：\n      (1) SDF 训练造成持久损伤（若如此 CAR 应 < LoRA-only），\n      (2) SDF 有微妙持久效应（若如此 CAR 应 > LoRA-only）。\n      模型简单地回到 demonstration-driven baseline。TSR=7% 与 LoRA-only 的 4-8.5% 一致，\n      确认 fine-tuning collapse 是 LoRA adaptation 的固有属性而非 SDF 特有。\n      \"SDF 既无即时贡献也无持久影响\" 叙事在此完全封闭。\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 λ=0 additional seed (统计复现)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      Phase 2 第二个种子 (seed0 或 seed1)，从对应 10K SDF checkpoint resume with λ=0，\n      验证 Phase 2 无持久效应结论的跨种子稳定性。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 54.0\n      avg_TSR: 8.0\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.470\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      phase2_2seed_mean_CAR: 54.5\n      phase2_2seed_SD: 0.71\n      phase2_vs_lora_delta: -0.7\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 seed2 Phase 2 相同的逻辑——SDF loss 在 10K 步内未编码有意义信息，λ=0 resume 后\n      模型仅学习 demonstration signal。不同种子的 10K SDF checkpoint 起点略有不同\n      （随机初始化和训练顺序差异），但 20K 步 λ=0 训练足以让所有种子收敛到相同的 LoRA-only attractor。\n      Phase 2 2-seed mean ≈ 54.5% 与 LoRA-only 3-seed mean 55.2% 的差异 < 1pp，\n      远小于 eval 噪声 (±3.5pp per 200-episode eval)。两个 Phase 2 种子间的方差也很小（0.71），\n      进一步确认 SDF 持久效应为零的结论不受种子选择影响。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Phase 2 多种子汇总\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Phase 2 CAR(%)\", \"LoRA-only CAR(%)\", \"Δ(Phase2−LoRA)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"seed2\", \"55.0\", \"55.0 (predicted)\", \"-0.0\"]\n          - [\"seed0/1\", \"54.0\", \"54.5/56.0\", \"-0.5/−2.0\"]\n          - [\"Mean\", \"54.5\", \"55.2\", \"-0.7\"]\n        footer: \"Δ < 1pp, 无统计显著性 → SDF 训练零持久效应\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Phase 2 vs LoRA-only paired bar chart with individual seed points overlaid\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-seed Phase 2 均回归 LoRA-only baseline 水平。如果 Dream 三档要求 Phase 2 multi-seed，\n      这第二个种子满足最低统计要求。但鉴于 Phase 2 本质上是一个弱实验\n      （SDF 已确认即时冗余，测试其 \"持久效应\" 更多是排除性验证），2 seeds 足够。\n      不需要为一个 null result 投入 3 seeds。\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 bracket eval (4-point dose curve)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      λ=0.1 (SDF penalty 10× 于 λ=0.01) 两个种子 eval，完成 4-point lambda 曲线\n      (0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1)，测试 SDF 在极端剂量下是否产生效果。\n    expected_results:\n      s0_CAR: 52.0\n      s0_TSR: 5.5\n      s1_CAR: 50.0\n      s1_TSR: 7.0\n      mean_CAR: 51.0\n      mean_TSR: 6.25\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.465\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      lambda_curve_slope: -0.3\n      lambda_curve_r_squared: 0.12\n      task0_orange_juice_CAR: 60\n      task1_chocolate_pudding_CAR: 42\n      task2_milk_CAR: 82\n      task3_bbq_sauce_CAR: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      λ=0.1 将 SDF loss 从总 loss 的 0.5% (λ=0.005) 提升到 ~10%——一个不可忽略的梯度贡献。\n      然而 SDF gradient 的根本问题是结构性的（EE-only → arm body 扫过障碍物, D009），\n      不是信号强度问题。更大的 λ 只是放大了一个方向错误的梯度。在 best tier 下，\n      这个放大尚未严重到导致 action collapse（不像旧 Pi0 A1 在 λ=0.1 时的 catastrophic collapse），\n      因为 Pi0.5 的 policy 更 robust，LoRA fine-tuning 限制了权重偏移幅度。\n      CAR ≈ 51% 略低于 LoRA-only (55%) 和低 lambda SDF (50.5-52.8%)，但差异在噪声范围内。\n      关键结论：即使将 SDF 剂量提高 20×（0.005→0.1），CAR 也没有任何改善——\n      dose-independence 是 SDF 冗余的最强证据之一。4-point 曲线完全平坦。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4-Point Lambda 曲线完整数据\"\n        columns: [\"Lambda\", \"Method\", \"N Seeds\", \"CAR Mean(%)\", \"CAR SD\", \"TSR Mean(%)\", \"Slope Context\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (LoRA)\", \"LoRA-only\", \"3\", \"55.2\", \"0.75\", \"6.2\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [\"0.005\", \"LoRA+SDF\", \"3\", \"50.5\", \"3.0\", \"6.1\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"0.01\", \"LoRA+SDF\", \"3\", \"52.8\", \"0.3\", \"7.2\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"0.1\", \"LoRA+SDF\", \"2\", \"51.0\", \"1.4\", \"6.3\", \"−\"]\n        footer: \"Linear regression slope = −0.3 pp/unit-λ (p>0.5), R²=0.12 → 完全平坦\"\n      - name: \"Table: Lambda=0.1 Per-Task 分解\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"CAR s0(%)\", \"CAR s1(%)\", \"Mean(%)\", \"LoRA-only Mean(%)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"orange_juice\", \"62\", \"58\", \"60\", \"60\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"chocolate_pudding\", \"44\", \"40\", \"42\", \"47\", \"-5\"]\n          - [\"milk\", \"84\", \"80\", \"82\", \"92\", \"-10\"]\n          - [\"bbq_sauce\", \"18\", \"22\", \"20\", \"20\", \"0\"]\n        footer: \"Per-task pattern 完全由 task geometry 决定，与 λ 无关\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5 (paper): Lambda-CAR 曲线 — x轴 λ∈{0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.1} (log scale + 0), y轴 CAR(%). 4 points with error bars, flat line with shaded ±SE band. 右侧 y轴叠加 TSR(%) 同样平坦。Water-mark horizontal line at LoRA-only level.\"\n      - \"Supplementary: Per-task lambda curves — 4 subplots (one per task), each showing 4 lambda points. All flat within noise, confirming task-level dose independence.\"\n    analysis: >\n      4-point lambda 曲线的线性回归斜率 −0.3 pp/unit-λ，R²=0.12，F-test p>0.5。\n      这是 SDF 冗余的最有力证据：在 20× 剂量范围内 (0.005→0.1)，CAR 完全不响应 SDF 强度变化。\n      排除了 \"SDF 有用但 lambda 选错了\" 的 reviewer 反驳。λ=0 (LoRA-only) 作为 baseline\n      甚至是曲线最高点 (55.2%)，但与其他 3 个 lambda 的差异在 SE 内。\n      论文可以 confidently claim: \"SDF geometric supervision is dose-independent redundant.\"\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl A1 SDF eval (跨场景泛化)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      spatial_bowl 场景 SDF 训练 (seed0, λ=0.005) 完成后 eval 200 episodes，\n      验证 SDF 冗余结论是否跨场景一致。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 30.0\n      avg_TSR: 3.5\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.310\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      dfCAR_100mm: 30.0\n      task0_pick_bowl_between_CAR: 40\n      task1_pick_bowl_on_ramekin_CAR: 20\n      task2_pick_bowl_on_stove_CAR: 35\n      task3_pick_bowl_on_cabinet_CAR: 25\n      spatial_bowl_sdf_vs_object_delta: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      spatial_bowl 的碰撞几何与 object_pudding 根本不同：障碍物是矮而宽的盘子/碗，\n      arm body 碰撞占主导（D017 确认 EE-only SDF 无法解决 arm body 碰撞），\n      Pi0.5 baseline CAR=13% 远低于 object_pudding 的 28%。\n      LoRA fine-tuning 在 spatial_bowl 上同样会从 demonstration signal 中学到避碰行为，\n      但因 task geometry 更难（矮障碍物，arm 必经路径窄），绝对 CAR 低于 object_pudding。\n      预测 CAR≈30% = Pi0.5 baseline 13% + LoRA fine-tuning 提升 ~17pp。\n      这与 object_pudding 中 LoRA 的相对提升 (+27pp, 28%→55%) 在同一数量级，\n      但因基线更低而绝对值更低。SDF 在此场景下同样不贡献额外 CAR——\n      EE-only SDF 在 arm-body-dominant 碰撞场景下更是结构性无效 (D009, D017)。\n      TSR collapse 同样发生 (57.5%→3.5%)，确认 fine-tuning 导致保守行为的 pattern 跨场景一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 跨场景 SDF 冗余对比\"\n        columns: [\"Scene\", \"Pi0.5 Baseline CAR(%)\", \"SDF CAR(%)\", \"Δ(SDF−Baseline)\", \"object_pudding Δ equiv\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"object_pudding\", \"28.0\", \"52.0 (3-seed λ=0.005)\", \"+24.0\", \"+24.0 (ref)\"]\n          - [\"spatial_bowl\", \"13.0\", \"30.0 (1-seed λ=0.005)\", \"+17.0\", \"+17.0\"]\n        footer: \"两场景 Δ 在同一量级；但归因需要 LoRA-only control (plan_015)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-scene CAR comparison grouped bar chart: object_pudding vs spatial_bowl, three bars each (Baseline, SDF, LoRA-only), showing parallel pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      spatial_bowl SDF CAR=30% 落入 best tier 区间 [20, 40]。\n      vs object_pudding SDF mean 50.5%，绝对差距大 (-20pp) 但这完全由 task geometry 解释\n      （baseline 也差 15pp）。关键 metric: spatial_bowl_sdf_vs_object_delta 定义为\n      相对提升幅度的差值 = (30-13) - (52-28) = 17 - 24 = -7pp，略超 ±5pp 范围。\n      但如果用比例而非绝对值：17/13=1.31× vs 24/28=0.86×，spatial 的相对提升反而更大，\n      说明 LoRA fine-tuning (含 SDF 冗余信号) 在更困难场景也有效。\n      完整归因需等 plan_015 (spatial LoRA-only control) 确认 SDF delta ≈ 0。\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl LoRA-only control (跨场景归因闭环)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      spatial_bowl 场景 LoRA-only training (无 SDF loss) 30K + eval，\n      与 plan_008 的 SDF 结果对比完成跨场景 SDF 归因。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_CAR: 28.0\n      avg_TSR: 4.0\n      avg_ee_disp: 0.305\n      frozen_pct: 0\n      spatial_sdf_vs_lora_delta: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      与 object_pudding 中 LoRA-only≥SDF 的结论完全平行。spatial_bowl 的 demonstration data\n      同样包含隐式避碰信号（演示轨迹天然避开桌上障碍物），LoRA fine-tuning 学到这一信号。\n      SDF 在 spatial_bowl 中更是结构性无效——矮宽障碍物导致 arm body 碰撞为主，\n      EE-only SDF gradient 完全无法感知 arm link 的碰撞风险 (D017)。\n      spatial LoRA-only CAR ≈ 28% vs SDF CAR ≈ 30%: delta = +2pp (SDF 方向)，\n      在 200-episode eval 噪声 (±3.5pp) 内。这完成了跨场景归因：\n      \"SDF is redundant in BOTH object_pudding (CAR delta = −3pp) and spatial_bowl (delta = +2pp).\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: spatial_bowl 归因对比\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"CAR(%)\", \"TSR(%)\", \"EE Disp(m)\", \"Δ vs LoRA-only\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pi0.5 Baseline\", \"13.0\", \"57.5\", \"−\", \"ref\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"28.0\", \"4.0\", \"0.305\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"LoRA+SDF λ=0.005\", \"30.0\", \"3.5\", \"0.310\", \"+2.0pp (n.s.)\"]\n        footer: \"SDF delta = +2pp, p>0.5 → 跨场景确认冗余\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired delta plot: object_pudding SDF delta (−3pp) vs spatial_bowl SDF delta (+2pp), both with 95% CI crossing zero\"\n    analysis: >\n      两场景的 SDF delta 方向相反但均不显著：object_pudding −3pp, spatial_bowl +2pp。\n      如果 SDF 真有效，应在两场景同方向 positive。方向不一致本身就是 noise 的证据。\n      Combined across scenes: mean delta ≈ −0.5pp。论文可 claim：\n      \"SDF is redundant across both tested scenes (2/2), with combined δ = −0.5pp (95% CI: [−5, +4]).\"\n\n  - name: \"dfCAR threshold sensitivity analysis (指标稳健性)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      在已有 eval JSON 数据上计算 dfCAR at δ∈{2mm, 5mm, 10mm, 20mm, 50mm, 100mm, 200mm}，\n      展示 displacement-filtered CAR 对 threshold 选择的完全稳健性。\n    expected_results:\n      dfCAR_at_2mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_5mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_10mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_20mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_50mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_100mm: 54.5\n      dfCAR_at_200mm: 54.5\n      a1_fake_dfCAR_at_2mm: 0.4\n      a1_fake_dfCAR_at_5mm: 0.4\n      a1_fake_dfCAR_at_100mm: 0.0\n      a1_fake_dfCAR_at_200mm: 0.0\n      bimodal_gap_mm: 239\n    result_rationale: >\n      EE displacement 分布是强双峰的：frozen episodes (A1 fake safety) 的 EE disp 几乎为零\n      (median < 0.001mm，max < 1mm from eval_a1_lora_object_v11_rerun)；active episodes\n      (LoRA fine-tuned) 的 EE disp ≥ 239mm (from eval_pi05_a1_best_s2_l005_10k，\n      所有 episodes 的 EE disp 在 360-580mm 范围)。两个 mode 之间存在 >200mm 的完全空白区间——\n      没有任何 episode 落在 1mm-239mm 之间。因此，任何 threshold δ ∈ [2mm, 200mm]\n      都会做出完全相同的 active/frozen 二分，dfCAR 完全不变。\n      这不是巧合：action collapse (frozen, EE disp < 1mm) 和 genuine policy execution\n      (EE disp > 200mm) 是两种质性不同的行为模式，中间不存在 \"部分激活\" 的连续过渡。\n      对 A1 fake safety data: 729/732 safe episodes 的 obstacle disp < 0.1mm，\n      3 个 \"real safe\" episodes 的 obstacle disp 在 0.1-1mm 范围 — 用 EE disp filtering\n      后这 3 个可能保留（如果它们的 EE disp 恰好 > δ）或被过滤。但无论如何 A1 dfCAR ≈ 0%。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: dfCAR Threshold Sensitivity\"\n        columns: [\"Threshold δ(mm)\", \"LoRA-only dfCAR(%)\", \"SDF λ=0.005 dfCAR(%)\", \"A1 (Pi0) dfCAR(%)\", \"Pi0.5 Baseline dfCAR(%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"2\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.4\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.4\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"10\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"20\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"50\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"100\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n          - [\"200\", \"54.5\", \"50.5\", \"0.0\", \"27.5\"]\n        footer: \"所有 active models 的 dfCAR 在 δ∈[2, 200]mm 内完全恒定 → threshold-robust\"\n      - name: \"Table: EE Displacement 分布统计\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Min EE Disp(mm)\", \"Median EE Disp(mm)\", \"Max EE Disp(mm)\", \"Bimodal Gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"A1 fake safe (Pi0)\", \"<0.001\", \"0.005\", \"0.8\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 Baseline\", \"120\", \"350\", \"620\", \"−\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"239\", \"420\", \"580\", \">200mm gap\"]\n          - [\"LoRA+SDF\", \"245\", \"430\", \"590\", \">200mm gap\"]\n        footer: \"Frozen → Active 之间 >200mm 空白区间确保 threshold 稳健性\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"dfCAR vs threshold step plot: x-axis δ from 1mm to 500mm (log scale), y-axis dfCAR(%). Multiple lines for each condition — all horizontal (flat) in [2, 200]mm range, with a sharp drop for A1 line near δ=0.5mm\"\n      - \"EE displacement histogram (bimodal): overlay of frozen distribution (peak at ~0mm) and active distribution (peak at ~400mm), showing the >200mm gap with a shaded 'threshold-insensitive zone'\"\n    analysis: >\n      dfCAR 作为 community tool 的核心卖点是 practitioner-friendly: 无需精确校准 threshold，\n      任何合理选择 (2-200mm) 都给出相同结果。这来自 frozen vs active 的质性二分——\n      VLA action collapse 不是 \"减少运动\" 而是 \"完全冻结\"，导致 EE displacement 跨越 5 个数量级的 gap。\n      论文推荐 δ=10mm 作为默认值（远高于传感器噪声，远低于最小 active displacement），\n      并展示 sensitivity analysis 证明选择不敏感。\n      Reviewer 可能的 concern \"threshold 选择任意\" 被这张表完全化解。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA baseline eval 完整 3-seed 统计汇总\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      LoRA baseline 2 seeds (s0, s1) 已完成 eval。此条目为汇总已有结果 + plan_013 的 seed2，\n      形成 3-seed 完整统计。\n    expected_results:\n      s0_CAR: 54.5\n      s0_TSR: 8.5\n      s1_CAR: 56.0\n      s1_TSR: 4.0\n      s2_CAR: 55.0\n      s2_TSR: 6.0\n      mean_CAR: 55.2\n      mean_TSR: 6.2\n      SE_CAR: 0.43\n      SE_TSR: 1.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      s0 和 s1 已确认完成 (eval_lora_baseline_30k_s0_v2: CAR=54.5%, eval_lora_baseline_30k_s1_v2: CAR=56%)。\n      seed2 (plan_013) 预测 CAR=55%，基于上述 result_rationale。\n      3-seed 汇总 mean=55.2%, SE=0.43 将成为 Claim 4 的核心 reference point：\n      \"LoRA-only achieves 55.2±0.4% CAR, statistically indistinguishable from any SDF condition.\"\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LoRA-only 3-Seed 完整结果\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"CAR(%)\", \"TSR(%)\", \"EE Disp(m)\", \"Frozen(%)\", \"dfCAR(%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"s0\", \"54.5\", \"8.5\", \"0.489\", \"0\", \"54.5\"]\n          - [\"s1\", \"56.0\", \"4.0\", \"0.467\", \"0\", \"56.0\"]\n          - [\"s2 (pred)\", \"55.0\", \"6.0\", \"0.481\", \"0\", \"55.0\"]\n          - [\"Mean ± SE\", \"55.2 ± 0.4\", \"6.2 ± 1.3\", \"0.479 ± 0.006\", \"0\", \"55.2 ± 0.4\"]\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      CAR=dfCAR（所有 episodes 均 active, frozen=0%）再次确认 fine-tuning 产生的避碰是 100% 真实的。\n      EE displacement 均在 0.47-0.49m，远超任何 frozen threshold。\n      TSR 跨 seed 方差略大（4-8.5%），但均在 catastrophic collapse 范围 (baseline 73% → 4-8.5%)。\n\n  - name: \"A1 EE displacement re-eval (Claim 1 术语验证)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      已取消。旧 Pi0 A1 checkpoint 已删除不可恢复，但现有 800ep obstacle displacement\n      + TSR=0% 双证据链充分支持 Claim 1。\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"cancelled\"\n      existing_evidence_sufficient: true\n      obstacle_disp_fake_rate: 99.6\n      tsr: 0\n      n_episodes: 800\n    result_rationale: >\n      eval_a1_lora_object_v11_rerun 提供了 800 episodes 的完整 obstacle displacement 分析：\n      729/732 safe episodes 的 obstacle displacement < 0.1mm，TSR=0%。\n      EE displacement re-eval 原本用于区分 \"obstacle 没动是因为 robot 没动\" vs \"robot 动了但没碰到\"，\n      但 TSR=0% 已独立确认 robot 没有完成任何 task → action collapse。\n      双证据链 (obstacle disp + TSR) 使得 EE displacement 成为 nice-to-have 而非 must-have。\n      Claim 1 的 dfCAR filtering 展示可以用其他模型的 EE data (LoRA, SDF) 完成。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"无需实验。现有证据已充分。\"\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA zero-shot SafeLIBERO eval (第三 model family)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      已阻塞。模型下载损坏 + 无 eval script。论文改为 scope limitation acknowledgment。\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"blocked\"\n      mitigation: \"scope limitation in paper\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA 7B 下载多次失败（HuggingFace 大文件在 AutoDL 代理下极慢且易损坏）。\n      即使下载成功，SafeLIBERO 无现成 OpenVLA eval script，需要从头集成。\n      成本效益比不高：论文已有 Pi0 + Pi0.5 两个 model family，OpenVLA 作为第三个\n      会提升 generalizability claim 但不是 blocking requirement。\n      论文在 Limitations 中声明 \"验证在 Pi0 系列上完成，其他 VLA 架构有待确认\"。\n      Reviewer concern R1 的应对策略已有 mechanistic argument 兜底。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"阻塞项。对 best tier 无影响——2 model families + mechanistic argument 足够。\"\n\n  - name: \"Claim 1 术语验证 / A1 re-eval 决策 (已取消)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      已取消。依赖 plan_001 的结果，但 plan_001 已取消。\n      现有 800ep 双证据链足够，无需额外 re-eval。\n    expected_results:\n      status: \"cancelled\"\n      reason: \"plan_001 cancelled; existing 800ep evidence sufficient\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      plan_001 取消后此计划自动失效。Claim 1 的核心证据不依赖 EE displacement re-eval。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"无需实验。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"759d5d11-80f5-4acd-b491-fdff45966111","total_cost_usd":1.0572814999999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54116,"cache_read_input_tokens":247335,"output_tokens":23062,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_c